    {
      "id": "claim_93c945942e3e4c3d83cc4cbf5708eaff",
      "statement": "GlobalExceptionHandler maps Jev-specific exceptions in addition to the pre-existing feed/Raindrop mappings: JevNotConfiguredException->503, CallNotPermittedException->503 (jev breaker open), TypeSafeBadRequestException/TypeSafeUnprocessableEntityException->422, and any other TypeSafeException->503; all Jev error details are fixed app text that never echoes a TypeSafe exception's message or body. The API surface also now includes /api/interest.",
