    {
      "id": "claim_5a2c9c93f4d84e0d8659766dc50bb6f7",
      "statement": "MyfeederProperties implements Spring's Validator and validates myfeeder.interest.* properties at bind time: concurrency/queue-capacity (scoring executor/queue sizing), sweep-delay/sweep-initial-delay/sweep-batch-size (InterestScoringSweep cadence), blend.tiers.high/neutral (badge thresholds), blend.engagement.open-weight/save-weight/cap (engagement learning, cap 0 disables it, otherwise 0<=open-weight<save-weight<1 and 0<cap<learned-cap), and suggestions.near-miss (gap discovery threshold, 0<near-miss<=0.5), rejecting startup with fixed text that never echoes the bound value.",
